<div id="block-mainpagecontent">
  
    
      <article>

  
    

  
  <div class="content-attributes">
          
<div class="usa-section layout meckco-layout--full-width inner-children
bg-meckco-none
meckco-section--spacing-outer-remove
meckco-section--spacing-inner-remove">
      <div  class="column-one-region">
      <div class="grid-container usa-section meckco-layout--column


"><div class="grid-row grid-gap"><div class="grid-col inner-children"><section class="hero-with-textbox"><div><div><picture><source
          srcset="https://mecknc.widen.net/content/ljn76nlxxe/web/mc-img-spe-hdr-tablemeeting.jpg?crop=yes&amp;w=1408&amp;h=500&amp;itok=txwTV6gI 1x"
          media="all and (min-width: 1024px)"
          type=""
        /><source
          srcset="https://mecknc.widen.net/content/ljn76nlxxe/web/mc-img-spe-hdr-tablemeeting.jpg?crop=yes&amp;w=1024&amp;h=500&amp;itok=4X2_uB0j 1x"
          media="all and (min-width: 377px)"
          type=""
        /><source
          srcset="https://mecknc.widen.net/content/ljn76nlxxe/web/mc-img-spe-hdr-tablemeeting.jpg?crop=yes&amp;w=376&amp;h=500&amp;itok=I-2cGrDG 1x"
          media=""
          type=""
        /><img
          src="https://mecknc.widen.net/content/ljn76nlxxe/web/mc-img-spe-hdr-tablemeeting.jpg?crop=yes&w=376&h=500&itok=I-2cGrDG"
    
    
    
    alt="Photo of people meeting at a table strategizing and planning."

    
    
      /></picture></div></div><div class="hero-with-textbox__content bg-meckco-gradient-color-teal"><h1 class="hero-with-textbox__heading meckco-heading-2  "
  >Office of Strategy &amp; Innovation</h1><div><p>Mecklenburg County’s Office of Strategy &amp; Innovation oversees organizational performance management and directs the Managing for Results framework, which includes the County’s Enterprise and Departmental scorecards.</p></div></div></section></div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

      <div class="grid-container usa-section meckco-layout--column

meckco-section--spacing-outer-sm
meckco-section--spacing-inner-remove">
                <div class="grid-row grid-gap">
      <div class="grid-col inner-children">
          <div  class="column-one-region">
      <div><p>Mecklenburg County strives every day to provide services to the community in an effective and efficient manner. To understand to what degree it does so, the Office of Strategy &amp; Innovation in the <a href="https://mgr.mecknc.gov/">County Manager’s Office</a> works to provide decision-makers the information they need to fully grasp the impact of County programs and services across community, as well as helps set the strategic direction for the County.&nbsp;</p></div>
    </div>
        </div>
    </div>
        </div>
<div class="grid-container usa-section meckco-layout--column
bg-meckco-color-overlay-gray
meckco-section--spacing-outer-sm
meckco-section--spacing-inner-remove">
                <div class="grid-row grid-gap">
      <div
        class="inner-children desktop:grid-col-6    ">
            <div  class="column-one-region">
      <div><div><div><img
          src="https://mecknc.widen.net/content/3wv5xyjyzl/web/m4results%20logo.png?v=1b83003d-ab57-4781-895b-498a61d447da"
    
    
    
    alt="m4results-logo"

    
    
          loading="lazy"
      /></div></div></div>
    </div>
        </div>
      <div
        class="inner-children desktop:grid-col-6    ">
            <div  class="column-two-region">
      <h2 class=" meckco-heading-3  meckco-highlight primary-color-teal "
  >FY2027 - Fy2030 Balanced Scorecard</h2><div><p>The Balanced Scorecard is a strategic management tool that organizes the County's work into key focus areas to deliver community results and strengthen internal capacity. Within these areas, objectives define the targets, while SMART goals track progress.</p></div><div><style type="text/css">.responsive-video {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              position: relative;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              padding-bottom: 56.25%; /* 16:9 aspect ratio */
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              height: 0;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              overflow: hidden;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            .responsive-video iframe {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              position: absolute;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              top: 0;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              left: 0;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              width: 100%;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              height: 100%;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              border: 0;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            }
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        </style><div class="image-text--content_button"><a class="usa-button usa-button--secondary" href="https://strategy.mecknc.gov/balanced-scorecard" target="_self">Learn about the Balanced Scorecard</a></div></div>
    </div>
        </div>
    </div>
        </div>
<div class="grid-container usa-section meckco-layout--column

meckco-section--spacing-outer-remove
meckco-section--spacing-inner-remove">
                <div class="grid-row grid-gap">
      <div class="grid-col inner-children">
          <div >
      
    </div>
        </div>
    </div>
        </div>
<div class="grid-container usa-section meckco-layout--column

meckco-section--spacing-outer-sm
meckco-section--spacing-inner-remove">
                <div class="grid-row grid-gap">
      <div class="grid-col inner-children">
          <div  class="column-one-region">
      <div><hr></div>
    </div>
        </div>
    </div>
        </div>
<div class="grid-container usa-section meckco-layout--column
bg-meckco-color-overlay-gray
meckco-section--spacing-outer-sm
meckco-section--spacing-inner-remove">
                <div class="grid-row grid-gap">
      <div
        class="inner-children desktop:grid-col-6    ">
            <div  class="column-one-region">
      <div><div><div><img
          src="https://mecknc.widen.net/content/i4oj56rhzq/web/qol%20logo.png?v=1ab82bd4-fe75-4d17-9fed-ea7a042dce53"
    
    
    
    alt="qol-logo"

    
    
          loading="lazy"
