    </div>
        </div>
      <div
        class="inner-children desktop:grid-col-6    ">
            <div  class="column-two-region">
      <h2 class=" meckco-heading-3  meckco-highlight primary-color-teal "
  >Quality of Life Collaborative</h2><div><p>The Quality of Life Collaborative (QLC) is a cross-sector partnership dedicated to making Charlotte-Mecklenburg a premier place to live. It fosters vital coordination among the City of Charlotte, Mecklenburg County, Charlotte-Mecklenburg Schools (CMS), and local community partners.</p></div><div><style type="text/css">.responsive-video {
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              position: relative;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              padding-bottom: 56.25%; /* 16:9 aspect ratio */
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              height: 0;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              overflow: hidden;
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            }
